20:51:04 [f9ca] Example 2 (setting: farm):
20:51:04 [f9ca]   Story: The farmer was stacking hay. He put the hay into a big pile. Now the farmer is finished. He wants to get in his tractor and drive home. A cow is standing in front of the tractor. She will not move out of the way!
20:51:04 [f9ca]   Questions:
